                                "sense_id": "1aecab54-f20f-3229-a47f-5b5af07951de",
                                "text": "Il n'existe aucune espèce connue d'apode capable de survivre dans de telles conditions.",
                                "translation": "There is no known limbless species capable of surviving in such conditions.",
                                "english": "There is no known limbless species capable of surviving in such conditions."
